<h2>The case in one view</h2>
<table class="law">
  <tr><th>Case</th><td>Pinki Kumari v. Ravi Kumar, First Appeal No. 68 of 2021 (2026:JHHC:32564-DB)</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Bench</th><td>M.S. Sonak, C.J. and Manoj Prasad, J., High Court of Jharkhand</td></tr>
